    API <--> OSRM["Project OSRM Routing"]`},{id:"passenger",title:"2. Passenger Search & Live Tracking",shortDesc:"From corridor search to interactive Leaflet map tracking and dynamic arrival ETAs.",icon:An,steps:[{number:"01",actor:"Passenger",action:"Enter Origin & Destination",detail:"Selects departure stop and arrival stop (e.g., Hisar to Fatehabad).",status:"User Input"},{number:"02",actor:"Stop Normalizer",action:"Phonetic Transliteration & Suffix Stripping",detail:"Normalizes Indian Romanization ('Hissar' -> 'Hisar') and strips suffixes ('Bus Stand', 'Bypass').",status:"Normalizer"},{number:"03",actor:"Search Engine",action:"Match Active Routes & Schedules",detail:"Filters routes where origin stop precedes destination stop in SequenceNo order.",status:"SQL Query"},{number:"04",actor:"Tracking View",action:"Open /track/:fleet & Connect WebSocket",detail:"Mounts Leaflet map, renders highway polyline, and joins SignalR room 'bus-{fleet}'.",status:"SignalR Room"},{number:"05",actor:"Live Progress",action:"Dynamic ETAs & Stop Status",detail:"Calculates minutes to boarding stop and destination at 42 km/h road speed with delay badge.",status:"Live Updates"}],mermaid:`flowchart TD
    Start(["Passenger Visits Site"]) --> Input["Search From & To Stops"]
